msgid ""
"&View active channel in external MPlayer for preview.\n"
"\n"
"To change the channel move Kalva in front with\n"
"ALT+TAB and choose a different channel.\n"
"\n"
"The white rectangle demonstrates what will be cut away\n"
"by crop.\n"
"\n"
"To preview the changes a certain quality profile brings,\n"
"just change the profile while the MPlayer is running.\n"
"The MPlayer will show the changes immediatly.\n"
"\n"
"Use MEncoder's shortcuts to \n"
"\n"
"toggle between fullscreen and normal view (  f  )\n"
"and to quit the MPlayer ( q )\n"
"\n"
"More shortcuts you may find in the MPlayer manpage."
msgstr ""
"&Antever a canle activo nun MPlayer externo\n"
"\n"
"Para cambiar de canle, dé o foco a Kalva mediante\n"
"ALT+TAB,  e escolla unha canle diferente.\n"
"\n"
"O rectángulo branco mostra o que será cortado.\n"
"\n"
"Para antever os efeitos dos cámbios dun perfil\n"
"de calidade, simplesmente mude de perfil mentres executa MPlayer.\n"
"MPlayer mostrará os cámbios de imediato.\n"
"\n"
"Use os atallos de MEncoder para\n"
"\n"
"comutar entre pantalla completa e vista normal (  f  )\n"
"e para sair de MPlayer ( q )\n"
"Poderá descobrir mais atallos na páxina de manual de MPlayer."

